it imports); its source maps hold DevTools' files unchanged, and its compiled code is
their compiler output, but for core/platform/HostRuntime.js: DevTools' packaging
replaces it with a stub, as HOST_RUNTIME's top-level await loads modules
(./browser/browser.js, ./node/node.js) that the package doesn't have. The same stub,
in the source (the compiled file is then the package's, but for comments).

